eenshots01.png", "id": "235918228322285", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_235918231655618_9200480916509836758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lgz99uhFcK8Q7kNvwFgNf5A&_nc_oc=Adlv4GzxCzoXYsWgfKcCg12oTVRjASDS8Biht5Br5SPTEXmnrbr-w4H_KyqoqQ9AbWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxnu9N2h2VuAXq0drn7NjcAQT-MbZD3nsdqqio1_8NfKw&oe=69B9669C"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots02.png", "id": "1202634946843386", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982715_1202634950176719_6841690957288523386_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CjbEyzX0pBwQ7kNvwEW9HVV&_nc_oc=AdkSCrJdseD09PthI-CLpSDHeJ0Yrp_13p8jbenpBJEspW2l8iKNCbr_mD3MX-IAm7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxmeMH_5VQTagThWm_BWUFfs3Oe034emcd5AHp1waCzGA&oe=69B94125"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots13.png", "id": "528250488391317", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001721_528250491724650_1577659830106612444_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TNlXvNNMo5wQ7kNvwHk9S4U&_nc_oc=Adk6oOrMxM-yuFZIlrJ5-6E27xlnFzAY7jNa_8aQP2pvPt5v7P34AOmZEIT_WM_c7c4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxkeqkn6cuD55f3p-wPgWCMfIwUqwZruWcPWNa_h1gnsA&oe=69B9356C"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots10.png", "id": "326371915829001", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_326371919162334_129873048362627550_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qIUU7VExot0Q7kNvwGNtOAl&_nc_oc=Adk0lkD_b42fg3z_LmTowas4H4RjOm-A1yCPU1yzJH7q_bKoo8dAEFqWyzpXd0oxG3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyVnUDtmoC6-Vhr--oN5xQHmYwVV6aJc746ry3uDxbYQQ&oe=69B93B2F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusCover2560x1440VIDEOENDSLATEWITHLEGAL.png", "id": "321306219352083", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035305_321306222685416_4438699296036008856_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QbdSbId4srgQ7kNvwHhq644&_nc_oc=AdkcUcYH2DWglUBTUK78_LEFgJVSV1b0oVVVBCePlIQbyycrDmXoqdIlXhMeCPOuyII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzNUZRQ1rTWJG2weYe_cyISswJUMPhBUagCzWgPlNepXA&oe=69B95AD6"}, "display_name": "Sam and Max: This Time It's Virtual!", "keywords": ["Comedy", "Adventure", "Narrative", "Action", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Sam is a dog with a hat.  Max is a hyperkinetic naked rabbity thing.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police, the intergalactically famous agents of indiscriminately applied justice, now starring in their umpteenth video game, Sam & Max: This Time It\u2019s Virtual!  Even multimedia evil-slappers like Sam & Max could use a hand, and this time they\u2019re using the incomprehensible magic of virtual reality to invite the player into their off-kilter world for a furious day of monster-slaying, obstacle courses, responsibly discharged firearms, and, of course, saving the entire freaking world.\nKey features:\n\u2022Discover the horrible and socially relevant secrets lurking behind, under, and within Cap\u2019n Aquabear\u2019s rotting theme park!\n\u2022Push yourself to be the best of the best of the middling, as a dog and a naked rabbity thing harangue and cajole you through a bewildering assortment of Freelance Police Academy training challenges.\n\u2022Immersion so real you can feel Sam\u2019s breath on your neck!\n", "short_description": "Sam is a dog in a suit.  Max is his naked rabbity partner.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police.  Jump into the not-quite-right world of Sam & Max via the wonder science of virtual reality, and join the multimedia darlings in their never-ending quest to slap the stupid grin off the face of evil."}]}, "developer_name": "HappyGiant", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_nam